<title>SWEDEN: Smedvig, Statoil in ship contract.</title>
<headline>Smedvig, Statoil in ship contract.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norway's Smedvig ASA said on Monday it signed a letter of agreement with state-owned oil and gas company Statoil on a long term contract for drilling and for the completion of wells.</p>
<p>The contract will have a duration of five, eight or 10 years. Based on a five year term the contract's value is around 2.0 billion crowns, Smedvig said.</p>
</text>
